// FAIL wide floor supports offset box: Near_Internal(World.GetPosition(Id).Y, 0.5, 0.08, 0)
// FAIL wide floor supports offset box with reversed creation order: Near_Internal(World.GetPosition(Id).Y, 0.5, 0.08, 0)
// FAIL wide floor supports box near its end: Near_Internal(World.GetPosition(Id).Y, 0.5, 0.08, 0)
// FAIL tall wall pushes out box near its top: Near_Internal(World.GetPosition(Id).X, 0.5, 0.04, 0)
// FAIL tall wall pushes out box near its bottom: Near_Internal(World.GetPosition(Id).X, 0.5, 0.04, 0)
// PASS narrow column supports box
// FAIL rotated floor supports offset box: Near_Internal(NormalGap, 0.5, 0.10, 0)
// PASS separated boxes stay put
// RESULT 21/27 passed
// 失敗理由: 横長床・縦長壁・回転床で側方クリップ幅が法線側半辺長のため、
